  "description": "Lightweight distributed caching library for .NET 9+ implementing Microsoft's HybridCache abstraction on top of Redis. Provides strongly typed caching with MessagePack serialization, distributed locking, rate limiting, stampede protection, and tag-based invalidation. Less than 500 lines of code for easy understanding and maintenance. Built on StackExchange.Redis with automatic health checks.",
